<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>POM Keeper Recovery Key</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="pom://app/static/css/fonts.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="pom://app/static/css/print.css">
</head>
<body>
  <article class="sheet">
    <header>
      <p class="overline">POM Keeper · Peace Of Mind Keeper</p>
      <h1>Recovery Key</h1>
      <p class="meta">Created <%= date %></p>
    </header>
    <div class="key"><%= recoveryKey %></div>
    <section>
      <h2>What this is</h2>
      <p>This key opens POM Keeper if the master password is forgotten. Anyone holding it, together with the computer or a backup file, can read the financial information inside.</p>
      <h2>How to use it</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Open POM Keeper.</li>
        <li>On the Unlock screen, click <strong>"Forgot your password? Use your recovery key."</strong></li>
        <li>Type the key above. Dashes and capital letters don't matter.</li>
        <li>Choose a new master password.</li>
      </ol>
      <h2>Keep it safe</h2>
      <p>Store this page with your will or other important papers, such as in a fire safe or safe deposit box. Don't keep it in the same place as the computer's password.</p>
    </section>
    <footer>Confidential · If you make a new recovery key, destroy this page.</footer>
  </article>
</body>
</html>
